  "sort": 200000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can magically summon a spectral tentacle that strikes at your foes. As a Bonus Action, you create a 10-foot-long tentacle at a point you can see within 60 feet of you. It lasts for 1 minute or until you create another one. When you create it, you can make a melee spell attack against one creature within 10 feet of it. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Cold damage, and its Speed is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn. The damage increases to 2d8 at Warlock level 10. As a Bonus Action on your turn, you can move the tentacle up to 30 feet and repeat the attack. You can summon the tentacle a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
